# Static files
# Note: if you want to commit generated images (charts), you might not want to ignore them.
# The charts are saved in events/static/events/img/ - let's ignore the generated charts so they don't pollute the repo,
# as they are generated on the fly. Or keep them? Usually static images generated at runtime should be ignored.
